    <string name="about_identity_html" translatable="false"><![CDATA[WeHavePhones: World of Warcraft on Android and Wine. Unofficial. Not affiliated with Blizzard.<br />
Source code and issues: <a href="https://github.com/ashmerra/wehavephones">github.com/ashmerra/wehavephones</a>]]></string>
    <string name="about_credits_html" translatable="false"><![CDATA[
Based on <a href="https://github.com/FrontMage/winlator-llm">Winlator LLM by FrontMage</a>,<br />
based on <a href="https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator">Winlator by BrunoSX</a>.<br /><br />
Runtime: <a href="https://www.winehq.org">Wine</a>, <a href="https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton">Proton</a>, <a href="https://github.com/The412Banner/proton-wine">GE-Proton arm64ec layers</a>, <a href="https://github.com/ptitSeb/box64">Box86/Box64 by ptitSeb</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX">FEX</a>, <a href="https://proot-me.github.io">PRoot</a>, talloc, patchelf.<br />
Userland: <a href="https://archlinuxarm.org">Arch Linux ARM</a>, rootfs-custom-winlator GStreamer supplement, PulseAudio, libsndfile, GNU Libtool.<br />
Graphics: <a href="https://www.mesa3d.org">Mesa (Turnip/Zink/VirGL)</a>, virglrenderer, libadrenotools, <a href="https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk">DXVK</a>, <a href="https://github.com/HansKristian-Work/vkd3d-proton">VKD3D-Proton</a>, D8VK, CNC DDraw, OpenXR SDK.<br />
Android: AndroidX, Material Components, zstd-jni, XZ for Java, Apache Commons Compress.<br />
Add-ons: <a href="https://github.com/seblindfors/ConsolePort">ConsolePort by seblindfors</a>.<br />
Design: Tiny5, Android sans-serif, Phosphor icons.<br /><br />
Thanks to all upstream contributors. Full recorded notices and license texts are available below.<br />
WeHavePhones is an independent, unofficial project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored, or approved by Blizzard Entertainment, Inc., Microsoft, the Winlator projects, or Qualcomm. It includes no Blizzard game files or assets. You need your own Blizzard account and game license.<br /><br />
World of Warcraft, Warcraft, Battle.net and Blizzard Entertainment are trademarks or registered trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. in the U.S. and/or other countries. All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners.
    ]]></string>
